a o Trail Longo de 32 km (1300m D+), o Trail Sprint de 22 km (670m D+), o Trail Curto de 13 km (450m D+) e a Caminhada de 11 km (300m D+).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui refei\u00e7\u00f5es e apoio a fam\u00edlias?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, todas as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es incluem pequeno-almo\u00e7o antes da partida, almo\u00e7o completo com porco no espeto, servi\u00e7o de kidsitting para crian\u00e7as e t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio para os atletas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio o porte de dorsal vis\u00edvel, telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, manta t\u00e9rmica e reservat\u00f3rio individual de \u00e1gua.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais realizam-se online na plataforma StopAndGo at\u00e9 6 de outubro de 2026, com informa\u00e7\u00f5es detalhadas no Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail da Ladeia 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-11\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Sede do CSCR de Alvorge, Ansi\u00e3o\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Ansi\u00e3o\", \"addressRegion\": \"Leiria\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"CSCR de Alvorge \/ Munic\u00edpio de Ansi\u00e3o \/ ADAL\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, hor\u00e1rio e local de partida do Trail da Ladeia 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no fim de semana de 10 e 11 de outubro de 2026 no CSCR de Alvorge (Ansi\u00e3o): Trail Kids no s\u00e1bado \u00e0s 15:00 e partidas de Trail e Caminhada no domingo a partir das 08:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e altimetrias dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento disponibiliza o Trail Longo de 32 km (1300m D+), o Trail Sprint de 22 km (670m D+), o Trail Curto de 13 km (450m D+) e a Caminhada de 11 km (300m D+).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui refei\u00e7\u00f5es e apoio a fam\u00edlias?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, todas as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es incluem pequeno-almo\u00e7o antes da partida, almo\